you have to wait until you're 12 or whatever.
Speaker 1: All right. So ban it eradicated. Fine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:33.240
So let's go through this piece by piece. This is&nbsp;
a way of getting attention and it's working. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:37.380
he's getting it. He's getting the hero's welcome&nbsp;
